{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《唱錢》的舞台上出現驚心動魄的一幕！「聲夢隊」成員冼靖峰（Archie）在演唱高難度歌曲《春秋》時，耳機竟突然失靈，面臨巨大考驗。與此同時，隊友何晉樂（Rock）更挑戰原唱Eric Kwok的地獄級作品《晏》，讓全場都為他們捏一把冷汗，場面極度緊張！</p><p>冼靖峰突發耳機失靈 臨危不亂裸聽上陣</p><p>今集最驚險的時刻，絕對落在冼靖峰（Archie）身上。他與何晉樂（Rock）合唱張敬軒的名曲《春秋》，賽前Archie已坦承：「對呢首歌熟，但好難唱。」沒想到在演唱途中，他的耳機突然失靈，完全失去監聽功能。面對如此突發狀況，Archie卻表現出超強的專業精神，臨危不亂，在之後的表演包括《餓狼傳說》中，都以「裸聽」狀態硬頂上陣，單靠現場音響完成演唱，穩定發揮令人佩服。</p><p>何晉樂挑戰原唱Eric Kwok地獄歌《晏》</p><p>「聲夢隊」的勇氣不止於此，何晉樂（Rock）更大膽選擇挑戰Eric Kwok的個人作品《晏》，連原唱Eric Kwok本人都驚訝表示：「我隻歌都夠膽挑戰，最難嗰 part 係 Verse。」這首歌曲以歌詞密集、節奏變幻莫測及對氣息控制要求極高而聞名。Rock在演唱時全神貫注，眉頭緊鎖，每個咬字都小心翼翼，緊張的氣氛感染了全場觀眾，彷彿大家都在陪他一起闖關。</p><p>《春秋》《晏》兩大地獄歌考起唱功</p><p>這次「聲夢隊」挑戰的兩首歌曲均是公認的「地獄級」作品。張敬軒的《春秋》音域極廣，包含大量真假音轉換及高音位，對歌手的換聲技巧是極大考驗，稍有不慎便會出現瑕疵。而Eric Kwok的《晏》則考驗歌手的節奏感和肺活量，密集的歌詞需要在極短時間內清晰吐出，同時保持情感的連貫性，難度極高，絕對是歌手的試金石。</p><p>網民激讚專業精神：真係藝高人膽大！</p><p>Archie和Rock的驚險演出，引來網民一面倒激讚，紛紛留言力撐他們的專業態度和勇氣。「Archie EQ好高，完全睇唔出有事，太專業！」「呢啲先係歌手，咩突發情況都handle到！」「Rock好有勇氣，敢喺Eric Kwok面前唱《晏》！」「睇到我手心都出汗，佢哋兩個都好勁！」「聲夢出品果然有保證，心理質素超強。」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/01_1979612336a63095dad1fe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/02_2987080066a63096002c8e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/03_14530780036a6309636a81d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/04_19897977496a63096678242.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/05_14689311336a63096a4ddcf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/06_18812729236a63096d551c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/07_16946129286a630970d5eaf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/08_3447332506a630973d208c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/09_15747701066a63097706e3d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/10_4208360596a63097a8016b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/11_12182252256a63097deab04.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/11a_1843995966a63098112ad7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/12_19024551046a630984167c9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/13_4962654476a630987d33c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/14_13348714246a63098b5eb37.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15_8024353236a6309904a604.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/16_5648557946a630993ed15e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17_2839388586a6309987e261.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/18_17948055366a63099c3c815.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/19_10908180476a6309a073952.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20_6319132126a6309a4a5a4e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/21_15800706246a6309a9ddb7f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/22_12849520376a6309adf0deb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/23_19499032916a6309b23b176.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/24_20466543886a6309b589014.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/25_21078100466a6309b89f943.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/26_90059266a6309bbd73b4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/27_1624963286a6309bf3f5c3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/28_2096896136a6309c28065d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/29_10306423866a6309c62014c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T06:58:26.475425+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1159,"images":30,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}